Bugfix: Keep the version when a concurrent request removes the versions folder

When a file was overwritten, files_versions created the versions folder and
then copied the old content into it. A MOVE or DELETE running at the same time
in the same tree could remove that still empty folder through its own cleanup.
The copy then failed, the upload still answered 204 and the previous version
was lost. The versions folder is now created again and the copy retried once.
